--- a/deeplabcut/pose_estimation_tensorflow/core/legacy_tf1.py
+++ b/deeplabcut/pose_estimation_tensorflow/core/legacy_tf1.py
@@ -20,6 +20,12 @@ here unchanged; those four files now contain none.  The file is reached only
 when the tf1 engine is selected (see ``nnets.factory.resolve_engine``),
 and it is meant to be deleted, whole, once they are the only implementation.
 
+Both training loops live here: ``train`` for single-animal projects and
+``train_multianimal`` for multi-animal ones.  Their callers,
+``core/train.py`` and ``core/train_multianimal.py``, own the prologue (the
+chdir, ``setup_logging`` and the config) and hand the loaded ``cfg`` down, so
+neither loop reads the configuration a second time.
+
 Nothing in here is new code -- it is the DeepLabCut 3.0.1 implementation,
 moved.
